MODEL= Model name (e.g., qwen2.5:3b,gpt-4o-mini, etc.)
MAX_TOOL_ROUNDS= Maximum number of tool rounds (e.g., 5)
SERVER_DIR= Path to the MCP server directory (e.g., /home/user/mcp-server)
DATETIME_ALLOWED_TOOLS= Comma-separated tool names the datetime client may use (e.g., get_current_date)
ROUTER_MODEL= Classifier model that only picks the tool (e.g., tev1:0.8b)
